{"3592770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravitus", "steam_appid": 3592770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a massive battlefield where two teams clash over resources, strategy, and firepower. Start as infantry, pilot hover tanks or flying pods, and unleash laser-based combat in a sci-fi warzone reminiscent of classic space battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Team Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two teams battle across a sprawling landscape. Coordinate with allies, defend your base, or go on the offensive to destroy the enemy core.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meteor Impact Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, a meteor crashes into the battlefield. Both teams race to the impact site, fight off enemy AI defenders, and mine precious Gravitium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mining &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gravitium from meteor sites and use it to purchase powerful upgrades: wall turrets, proximity mines, new weapons, and attribute boosts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly transition between on-foot combat and high-speed hover tanks or flying pods. Take control of the battlefield from land or air.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Futuristic Laser Weaponry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemies with vibrant, sci-fi-inspired laser rifles, sniper weapons, and explosive grenade launchers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Defense &amp; Siege</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base with automated defenses and traps while plotting an assault on the enemy core. Fortify your stronghold and prepare for all-out sieges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Combatants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy AI guards protect critical areas and resources, adding another layer of challenge and excitement to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for intense sci-fi warfare where strategy, teamwork, and firepower decide the fate of the battlefield. Will your team destroy the enemy core and claim victory?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a massive battlefield where two teams clash over resources, strategy, and firepower. Start as infantry, pilot hover tanks or flying pods, and unleash laser-based combat in a sci-fi warzone reminiscent of classic space battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Team Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two teams battle across a sprawling landscape. Coordinate with allies, defend your base, or go on the offensive to destroy the enemy core.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meteor Impact Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, a meteor crashes into the battlefield. Both teams race to the impact site, fight off enemy AI defenders, and mine precious Gravitium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mining &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gravitium from meteor sites and use it to purchase powerful upgrades: wall turrets, proximity mines, new weapons, and attribute boosts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly transition between on-foot combat and high-speed hover tanks or flying pods. Take control of the battlefield from land or air.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Futuristic Laser Weaponry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemies with vibrant, sci-fi-inspired laser rifles, sniper weapons, and explosive grenade launchers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Defense &amp; Siege</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base with automated defenses and traps while plotting an assault on the enemy core. Fortify your stronghold and prepare for all-out sieges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Combatants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy AI guards protect critical areas and resources, adding another layer of challenge and excitement to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for intense sci-fi warfare where strategy, teamwork, and firepower decide the fate of the battlefield. Will your team destroy the enemy core and claim victory?</p>", "short_description": "Enter a massive battlefield where two teams clash over resources, strategy, and firepower. Start as infantry, pilot hover tanks or flying pods, and unleash laser-based combat in a sci-fi warzone reminiscent of classic space battles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592770/09c1d619bdaed1aeb76148614153c6e965bc4e52/header.jpg?t=1783006465", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592770/21a5455d011a92179631ca7f9f041550ac1da4f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783006465", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592770/21a5455d011a92179631ca7f9f041550ac1da4f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783006465", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 2nd Gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek HD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7 8th Gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound 